sequenceDiagram
  actor Source
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Detection as Detection service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Source->>API: POST normalized event
  API->>Detection: Validate and authenticate
  Detection->>DB: Lock rule set, source event and customer
  alt same source event and payload
      DB-->>Source: Original assessment through API
  else changed payload
      DB-->>Source: 409 through API
  else new event
      Detection->>DB: Get active rules and earlier history
      Detection->>Detection: Compute features and score
      Detection->>DB: Insert transaction, assessment, optional alert and audit
      DB-->>Source: Commit and return assessment through API
  end
